OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMorning showers, some being
OL,6,Fheavy at times in the south, move
OL,7,Feastwards across the region through
OL,8,Fthe morning, clearing for a time,
OL,9,Fbefore returning later on in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Some sunny spells in
OL,11,Fbetween.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy and thundery showers
OL,14,Fare possible at times through the
OL,15,Fevening and overnight. Surface water
OL,16,Fissues are possible. A relatively cool
OL,17,Fnight for some rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
