OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAny remaining heavy and
OL,6,Fthundery showers gradually clear to
OL,7,Fthe south of the region through the
OL,8,Fmorning, to leave a brighter
OL,9,Fafternoon, with just a few lighter
OL,10,Foutbreaks of rain.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,14,Finto the weekend. Isolated showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing on Friday, but becoming
OL,16,Fmore settled again heading into the
OL,17,Fweekend with an increasing number of
OL,18,Fsunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
